{"title": "Tata Sons Chairman N. Chandrasekaran to Step Down; Succession Process Begins", "summary": "N. Chandrasekaran is preparing to step down as Chairman of Tata Sons after nearly a decade. The Sir Dorabji Tata Trust has passed a resolution to initiate the formation of a selection committee to recommend a successor. This development intensifies focus on succession planning and a potential stock market listing for Tata Sons, the holding company of 31 group entities. Some reports suggest a boardroom standoff as a factor in his departure, while others indicate the Trusts are respecting his decision to step down.", "summary_points": ["N. Chandrasekaran is preparing to resign as Chairman of Tata Sons.", "The Sir Dorabji Tata Trust has initiated the process to form a selection committee for a new chairman.", "The succession plan for Tata Sons is underway.", "The development brings renewed focus on a potential stock market listing for Tata Sons.", "Reports suggest a boardroom standoff may have contributed to the decision to step down."], "title_hi": "टाटा संस के चेयरमैन एन. चंद्रशेखरन पद छोड़ेंगे; उत्तराधिकार प्रक्रिया शुरू", "summary_hi": "एन. चंद्रशेखरन लगभग एक दशक के बाद टाटा संस के चेयरमैन पद से हटने की तैयारी कर रहे हैं। सर…", "summary_points_hi": ["एन. चंद्रशेखरन टाटा संस के चेयरमैन पद से इस्तीफा देने की तैयारी कर रहे हैं।", "सर…", "टाटा संस के लिए उत्तराधिकार योजना शुरू हो गई है।", "इस घटनाक्रम से टाटा संस की संभावित शेयर बाजार लिस्टिंग पर नया ध्यान केंद्रित हुआ है।", "रिपोर्टों से पता चलता है कि बोर्डरूम में गतिरोध उनके इस्तीफे का एक कारण हो सकता है।"], "framing": {"center": ["Tata Trusts have begun the process to set up a selection committee for the next Tata Sons chairman.", "The Sir Dorabji Tata Trust passed a resolution to initiate the setting up of a selection committee.", "The succession plan for Tata Sons is underway with the formation of a panel.", "The holding company meeting on August 18 is critical.", "There is increased focus on a potential stock market listing for Tata Sons."], "right": ["Reports suggest a boardroom standoff led to N. Chandrasekaran's exit from Tata Sons.", "Tata Trusts stated no joint representative can be nominated for the Tata Sons AGM.", "Tata Trusts are respecting N. Chandrasekaran's decision to step down while beginning the succession process."]}, "framing_hi": {"center": ["टाटा ट्रस्ट ने टाटा संस के अगले चेयरमैन के लिए चयन समिति गठित करने की प्रक्रिया शुरू कर दी है।", "सर…", "टाटा संस के लिए उत्तराधिकार योजना समिति के गठन के साथ शुरू हो गई है।", "18 अगस्त को होने वाली होल्डिंग कंपनी की बैठक महत्वपूर्ण है।", "टाटा संस की संभावित शेयर बाजार लिस्टिंग पर ध्यान केंद्रित किया गया है।"], "right": ["रिपोर्टों से पता चलता है कि बोर्डरूम में गतिरोध के कारण एन. चंद्रशेखरन को टाटा संस से बाहर निकलना पड़ा।", "टाटा ट्रस्ट ने कहा कि टाटा संस एजीएम के लिए कोई संयुक्त प्रतिनिधि नामित नहीं किया जा सकता।", "टाटा ट्रस्ट उत्तराधिकार प्रक्रिया शुरू करते हुए एन. चंद्रशेखरन के पद छोड़ने के फैसले का सम्मान कर रहे हैं।"]}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://images.indianexpress.com/2026/08/n-chandrasekaran.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "The Indian Express", "owner": "Indian Express Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://indianexpress.com/article/business/tata-trusts-process-selection-committee-tata-sons-chairman-n-chandrasekaran-exit-10831219", "headline": "Tata Trusts begins process to set up selection committee for next Tata Sons chairman"}, {"source": "Mint", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/companies/news/tata-trusts-kickstarts-process-for-finding-a-successor-for-tata-sons-11786605020002.html", "headline": "Tata Trusts kickstarts process for finding a successor for Tata Sons chair N Chandrasekaran"}, {"source": "Republic World", "owner": "Republic World", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "What Led to N Chandrasekaran's Exit From Tata 